{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12433","headline":"酬考功杨员外见赠佳句 · 钱起","name":"酬考功杨员外见赠佳句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上林谏猎知才薄，尺组承恩愧命牵。\n潢潦难滋沧海润，萤光空尽太阳前。\n虚名滥接登龙士，野性宁忘种黍田。\n相国无私人守朴，何辞老去上皇年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}